text: >-
  Project Constitution @ProjectConstitu • 19m

  O.••

  EXCLUSIVE: UVU Police's SHOCKING Response to Our GRAMA Request

  — "No Records" on the Man Caught Sneaking into Charlie Kirk's

  Assassination Crime Scene? This Can't Be Real.

  One day after Charlie Kirk was gunned down on Sept. 10, 2025, at Utah

  Valley University, Russell Kim Kennington was arrested red-handed:

  dressed as a doctor in a white lab coat, carrying a rifle, trying to
  infiltrate

  the active crime scene. Charged with felony obstruction of justice and

  criminal trespassing-no gun charge filed, despite the weapon.

  Then, the unbelievable: UVU released him on ROR-ZERO bail. A felony

  suspect with a rifle at a fresh assassination site walks free? Our team

  suspected intel ties-maybe a Langley asset pulling strings. That's why

  @CamelotJack1963, a cornerstone of our Charlie Kirk Investigatory

  Committee, filed a GRAMA request on Oct. 18 for basics: police reports,

  probable cause, bodycam, booking docs, mug shot.

  Fast-forward to yesterday: UVU's reply? "We have no records responsive to

  your request." Lies. They arrested him-booked him into Utah County Jail.

  At minimum, charging docs and a photo exist. This blatant stonewalling

  screams cover-up, deepening our conviction: Charlie's murder was no lone

  wolf hit. It's a conspiracy, and they're hiding the proof.

  We won't stop. Justice demands transparency.

  Huge thanks to @CamelotJack1963 —your relentless pursuit keeps this

  investigation alive. FOLLOW him TODAY for raw, unfiltered insights. Who's

  ready to demand answers? Tag a friend, share widely.

  request.

  November 3, 2025, 4:20pm by Staff

  • Message to requester Requester + Stat

  25-265

  November 3, 2025

  Camelot Jack

  Dear Camelot Jack:

  This notice responds to your Utah

  Government Records Access and

  Management Act (GRAMA) request dated

  October 18, 2025, seeking:

  "access to and copies of the following public

  Camelot Jack

  Project Constitution @ProjectConstitu • Oct 18

  * ALERT: Remember the Fake Doctor Busted with a

  Rifle at Charlie Kirk's Crime Scene the Day After the

  Hit? What I Found Out About Him Is Alarming-He

  Needs to Be Investigated.

  4:54
